      "id": "HJR47",
      "number": "HJR 47",
      "type": "HJR",
      "chamber": "House",
      "caption": "Proposing a constitutional amendment protecting private schools from state and local regulation.",
      "author": "Vasut",
      "lastAction": "H Filed",
      "actionDate": "2026-11-09",
      "historyUrl": "https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=90R&Bill=HJR47",
      "textPageUrl": "https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/Text.aspx?LegSess=90R&Bill=HJR47",
      "topics": [
        "Schools & education",
        "Religious exercise"
      ],
      "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-11-13T14:04:46+00:00",
      "firstSeen": "2026-11-11T17:12:54+00:00",
      "reviewState": "Text reviewed",
      "summary": "Would propose a constitutional amendment barring state and local government, including the Legislature, from regulating a private school’s educational program, including a home school’s program. It proposes submission to voters on November 2, 2027.",
      "relevance": "Could affect the autonomy of religious and other private schools. This is a proposed constitutional amendment and would require the applicable legislative and voter approvals.",
      "title": "Constitutional protection for private-school programs",
