      "reviewState": "Text reviewed",
      "summary": "Would extend the marriage-related religious protections in Family Code sections 2.601 and 2.602 to individuals generally. Protected refusals would include services, goods, accommodations, and facilities, with protections against specified civil actions and government penalties or loss of benefits.",
